NOTE ON DATA AND DERIVED CONTENT

The MIT licence above covers the source code in this repository.

The raw single-cell RNA sequencing data are NOT distributed here. They are
obtained from NCBI GEO accession GSE174574 and remain subject to the terms
under which their original authors deposited them. Please cite the original
data generators (Zheng et al., J Cereb Blood Flow Metab, 2022) in addition to
this repository.

Figures, tables and the LaTeX manuscript source under `manuscript/` are part
of an academic publication; please cite the paper rather than redistributing
them as your own.
